Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.79,Default,,60,60,0,,This tiny creature\Ndelivers the FASTEST punch
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.79,0:00:05.59,Default,,60,60,0,,on Earth. Forget\NMike Tyson; the Mantis
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.59,0:00:08.38,Default,,60,60,0,,Shrimp hits\Nwith the force of a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.38,0:00:11.17,Default,,60,60,0,,.22 caliber bullet,\Nreaching speeds of 50
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.17,0:00:13.96,Default,,60,60,0,,miles per hour\Nfrom a standing start.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.96,0:00:16.76,Default,,60,60,0,,Its clubs can shatter\Naquarium glass instantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.76,0:00:19.55,Default,,60,60,0,,But it’s not just\Nbrute force. When
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.55,0:00:22.34,Default,,60,60,0,,it punches, it creates\Nsuperheated cavitation bubbles
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.34,0:00:25.14,Default,,60,60,0,,that can boil water,\Ngenerating a secondary,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.14,0:00:27.93,Default,,60,60,0,,even more devastating\Nshockwave. And its eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.93,0:00:30.72,Default,,60,60,0,,They're alien. Unlike\Nhumans with three color
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.72,0:00:33.52,Default,,60,60,0,,receptors, Mantis Shrimp\Nhave a staggering sixteen!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.52,0:00:36.31,Default,,60,60,0,,They can see\Npolarized light and even
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.31,0:00:39.10,Default,,60,60,0,,some types of cancer.\NImagine perceiving the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.10,0:00:41.90,Default,,60,60,0,,world with such an\Nimmense spectrum of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.90,0:00:44.69,Default,,60,60,0,,color and hidden\Nsignals. What other hidden
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.69,0:00:47.48,Default,,60,60,0,,senses are out\Nthere, waiting to be
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.48,0:00:47.88,Default,,60,60,0,,discovered?